Package: ecTools
Title: Tools for Ecosystem Condition Accounting and Assessments
Version: 0.0.0.9001
Authors@R: 
    person("Anders", "Kolstad", , "anders.kolstad@nina.no", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9623-9491"))
Description: This package contains functions to process (mainly spatial) data and produce output for an ecosystem account or assessment. The main focus is on Ecosystem Condition Accounts - scaling and agrgegating indicators.
